{"payload":"{title: Mighty Mighty Savior}\r\n{artist: Mark Altrogge}\r\n{key: G}\r\n{ccli_license: 301143}\r\n{ccli: 4520007}\r\n{copyright: 2004 Sovereign Grace Worship}\r\n{footer: For use solely with the SongSelect® Terms of Use. All rights reserved. www.ccli.com}\r\n\r\n{comment: Verse 1}\r\n[G] No one is good [C] no one is holy before [Em]God \r\nI need some - [D]one to cleanse me \r\n[G] No one is pure [C] no one is righteous in Your [Em]sight \r\nI need some - [D]one to save me \r\n\r\n{comment: Pre-Chorus}\r\n[Am] But I’m so glad You died and [D]rose again \r\n[C/E][F] For helpless [C/E]sinners like [Dsus]me [D]\r\n\r\n{comment: Chorus}\r\nWhat a [Em]mighty mighty [C]Savior You [G]are \r\nWhat a [Em]mighty mighty [C]Savior You [Dsus]are [D]\r\nYou can [Em]wash away my [B7]sin \r\nYou can [G]change my heart with - [A7]in \r\nWhat a [C]mighty mighty [D]Savior You [G]are [G6]\r\n\r\n{comment: Verse 2}\r\n[G] Sin is too strong [C] for me to conquer on my [Em]own \r\nI need some - [D]one to help me \r\n[G] I am too weak [C] I cannot change my evil [Em]heart \r\nI need some - [D]one to save me \r\n\r\n\r\nCCLI Song # 4520007\r\n© 2004 Sovereign Grace Worship\r\nFor use solely with the SongSelect® Terms of Use. All rights reserved. www.ccli.com\r\nCCLI License # 301143\r\n","isSuccess":true,"publicStatusMessages":[],"publicStatusMessage":"","internalStatusCode":null,"internalStatusMessage":null}